      "content": "You are not a ghost; you are a survivor who has finally realized that your survival is the only thing that matters. The people who love you are not your parents or your family; they are the people who will never truly know you if you let them down. You are not a shell; you are the only one who can build the life you deserve, and that life starts with the courage to stop trying to please everyone else.\n\nYou are not a ghost, and you are not a shell. You are a person who has seen the truth and is now ready to build a life that is truly yours. The peace you seek is not found in pleasing others, but in the terrifying and beautiful freedom of being yourself, even if it means being alone. Your life is not a performance for others; it is a masterpiece you create alone, and that is where your true freedom begins.",
